// three value props, "Made for your work", "Safe by design", "Pay once" (the pricing section), the FAQ
// and the closing call to action. "Kept up to date" waits for the update feed (#122). The markup is
// shared; `copy` holds each language's strings. Strings rendered with set:html carry inline markup.
